34:22.980 --> 34:23.980
Very messy.

34:23.980 --> 34:30.980
What happens when multiple people, or worse, multiple autonomous AI agents are operating in the exact same folder at the exact same time?

34:30.980 --> 34:32.980
Multiplayer mode.

34:32.980 --> 34:36.980
Multiplayer mode fundamentally changes the nature of the berm.

34:36.980 --> 34:39.980
Because suddenly, status alone is not enough to prevent chaos.

34:39.980 --> 34:40.980
Why not?

34:40.980 --> 34:43.980
Status answers what action is admissible.

34:43.980 --> 34:47.980
It does not answer who presently has the right to perform it.

34:47.980 --> 34:48.980
Ah.

