So if a file is marked open, how do I know my coworker Alice hasn't already started working on it?

34:53.980 --> 34:55.980
I don't want to duplicate her labor.

34:55.980 --> 34:56.980
Right.

34:56.980 --> 35:03.980
But wait, why can't I just add a new word to the 10-word vocabulary? Why can't I just name the file claimed data model?

